>》</li>\n<li>《<a class=\"ih3\" href=\"/gushi/tangdai/zhangjiuling/1251.htm\" title=\"送苏主簿赴偃师\">送苏主簿赴偃师</a>》</li>\n\n\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul id=\"fn3_5\">\n\t\t\t <li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5736.htm\" title=\"向来吟秀句，不觉已鸣鸦。\">“向来吟秀句，不觉已鸣鸦。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5737.htm\" title=\"娇艳轻盈香雪腻，细雨黄莺双起。\">“娇艳轻盈香雪腻，细雨黄莺双起。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5738.htm\" title=\"翅低白雁飞仍重，舌涩黄鹂语未成。\">“翅低白雁飞仍重，舌涩黄鹂语未成。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5739.htm\" title=\"燕子不来花又老，一春瘦的腰儿小。\">“燕子不来花又老，一春瘦的腰儿小。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5740.htm\" title=\"人情已厌南中苦，鸿雁那从北地来。\">“人情已厌南中苦，鸿雁那从北地来。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5741.htm\" title=\"黄莺也爱新凉好，飞过青山影里啼。\">“黄莺也爱新凉好，飞过青山影里啼。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5742.htm\" title=\"玉阶空伫立，宿鸟归飞急。\">“玉阶空伫立，宿鸟归飞急。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5743.htm\" title=\"何当击凡鸟，毛血洒平芜。\">“何当击凡鸟，毛血洒平芜。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5744.htm\" title=\"飞鸟没何处，青山空向人。\">“飞鸟没何处，青山空向人。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5745.htm\" title=\"行舟逗远树，度鸟息危樯。\">“行舟逗远树，度鸟息危樯。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5746.htm\" title=\"井放辘轳闲浸酒，笼开鹦鹉报煎茶。\">“井放辘轳闲浸酒，笼开鹦鹉报煎茶。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5747.htm\" title=\"渔父天寒网罟冻，莫徭射雁鸣桑弓。\">“渔父天寒网罟冻，莫徭射雁鸣桑弓。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5748.htm\" title=\"何似当筵虎士，挥手弦声响处，双雁落遥空。\">“何似当筵虎士，挥手弦声响处，双雁落遥空。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5749.htm\" title=\"未羞他、双燕归来，画帘半卷。\">“未羞他、双燕归来，画帘半卷。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5750.htm\" title=\"燕子不知人去也，飞认阑干。\">“燕子不知人去也，飞认阑干。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5751.htm\" title=\"王粲登临寥落际。雁飞不断天连水。\">“王粲登临寥落际。雁飞不断天连水。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5752.htm\" title=\"别路琴声断，秋山猿鸟吟。\">“别路琴声断，秋山猿鸟吟。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5753.htm\" title=\"鸟声有悲欢，我爱口流血。\">“鸟声有悲欢，我爱口流血。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5754.htm\" title=\"溪上桃花无数，花上有黄鹂。\">“溪上桃花无数，花上有黄鹂。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5755.htm\" title=\"桃花落后蚕齐浴，竹笋抽时燕便来。\">“桃花落后蚕齐浴，竹笋抽时燕便来。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5756.htm\" title=\"棹动芙蓉落，船移白鹭飞。\">“棹动芙蓉落，船移白鹭飞。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5757.htm\" title=\"桐叶落，蓼花残。雁声天外寒。\">“桐叶落，蓼花残。雁声天外寒。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5758.htm\" title=\"子规啼彻四更时，起视蚕稠怕叶稀。\">“子规啼彻四更时，起视蚕稠怕叶稀。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5759.htm\" title=\"露叶翻风惊鹊坠。暗落青林红子。\">“露叶翻风惊鹊坠。暗落青林红子。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5760.htm\" title=\"龟游莲叶上，鸟宿芦花里。\">“龟游莲叶上，鸟宿芦花里。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5761.htm\" title=\"门外平桥连柳堤，归来晚树黄莺啼。\">“门外平桥连柳堤，归来晚树黄莺啼。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5762.htm\" title=\"莫惊鸥鹭，四桥尽是，老子经行处。\">“莫惊鸥鹭，四桥尽是，老子经行处。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5763.htm\" title=\"疏雨池塘见，微风襟袖知。阴阴夏木啭黄鹂。\">“疏雨池塘见，微风襟袖知。阴阴夏木啭黄鹂。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5764.htm\" title=\"林中有奇鸟，自言是凤凰。\">“林中有奇鸟，自言是凤凰。”</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;〖<a class=\"ih2\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/\">写鸟</a>〗&nbsp;<a class=\"ih4\" href=\"/shiju/xiewu/xieniao/5765.htm\" title=\"人行明镜中，鸟度屏风里。\">“人行明镜中，鸟度屏风里。”</a></li>\n\n\t\t</ul>\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"cl\"></div>\n</div><!--flink结束-->\n\n</div><!--mainbg结束-->\n<!--<div style=\"text-align:center; width:990px;MARGIN: 10px auto 0px\"><SCRIPT language=javascript type=text/javascript src='/images/adsense-match--.js'></SCRIPT></div>-->\n<div id=\"footer\">\n<p class=\"p\"><a href=\"http://m.dzkbw.com/books/yilin/yingyu/4b/\">手机版</a>|<a href=\"/books/rjb/\">人教版</a>|<a href